{"id":"a06429cf-efe5-4500-8cdf-a965bdf6d565","rule_id":"b347b919-665f-4aac-b9e8-68369bf2340c","name":"【默认】Linux异常用户名活动（机器学习）","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":208,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:18.445Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:56:13.635Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"15m","from":"now-45m","to":"now","description":"机器学习规则：检测主机上罕见或异常的 主机 用户名活动。对应需求：异常账号使用 / 登录审计补充。","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则来源: 默认","用例: 身份与访问审计","规则类型: 机器学习"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":">=1.18.0"},{"package":"endpoint","version":">=9.0.0"}],"required_fields":[],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n机器学习判定用户名异常。\n\n### 为何重要\n少见用户可能表示未授权访问或横向移动。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认用户是否合法。\n2. 查看关联进程与登录。\n3. 基线学习期告警需人工确认。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["新账号刚投产、基线尚未稳定"],"references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"low","severity_mapping":[],"output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"machine_learning","anomaly_threshold":50,"machine_learning_job_id":["v3_linux_anomalous_user_name_ea"]}
